Bluetooth codec status, badges and selection for crDroid Settings
Source snapshot: 2026-10-04.

UPSTREAM SOURCES AND COMPATIBILITY

This distribution contains source-code diffs for crDroid branch 16.0 (Android 16).
Other ROMs are outside the current scope. It is not a ROM image and contains no
codec implementation: it only reads and requests codec configurations through the
public Android Bluetooth API (BluetoothCodecStatus, BluetoothCodecConfig,
BluetoothA2dp.setCodecConfigPreference). Which codecs and sample rates exist is
decided by the Bluetooth stack and the connected device.

The affected SettingsLib and Settings files in crDroid retain their upstream
Apache License, Version 2.0, terms and attribution notices, including those of
The Android Open Source Project. Newly created files are licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0.
