Reference repositories, commits and public sources (crDroid branch 16.0):
  frameworks/base               a7b0e5e188fb72a566328bfed0e0412ddb7850e2  https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android_frameworks_base
  packages/apps/Settings        62faa70985307e4e5fca0c7c838f11dba0b2c4ab  https://github.com/crdroidandroid/android_packages_apps_Settings

The series was built into crDroid 16.0 on the OnePlus 13 (dodge, CPH2653) and used
with dual-mode receivers and with receivers whose details page is provided by a
companion app. No device-specific code is involved.

